racter progression - gain experience, level up and unlock skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching dialogues and complex narrative with multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack by micAmic and guests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full English voice acting</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/extras/22bd0ae1c1a857a815eea72033870246.poster.avif?t=1752823622\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/extras/22bd0ae1c1a857a815eea72033870246.webm?t=1752823622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/extras/22bd0ae1c1a857a815eea72033870246.mp4?t=1752823622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
